  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The foundational image I/O library for biomedical microscopy used by QuPath, ImageJ/FIJI, OMERO, and virtually every WSI analysis tool to read proprietary scanner formats. 150+ formats supported, 20+ years of active OME consortium development, v8.5.0 March 2026. GPL-2.0 copyleft applies to redistribution but does not restrict use as a library dependency in research pipelines. Adopt as the standard format reading layer for any pathology or microscopy imaging pipeline.",
